From 55dc5bdabc737b5a2bd15991d124e7e9ef3f02ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ilyatbn <ilyatbn@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 08:19:12 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] d3d10umd video: H.264 decode on the Exynos MFC (exynos-woa
 0086, G17 V6b3) - SPS/PPS rebuilt from DXVA picture parameters (VideoH264.c),
 decode-order MFC session per decoder, slice NALs per EndFrame, NV12 written
 into the output view; Media Foundation decodes bit-exact (720p and 1080p with
 B-frames)

---
